t AI, and against others just as desperate. And you've heard the stories. There\u2019s a place. A hope, a dream. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>They call it, </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cyborg City.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TORCH-SHAPED CYBORG CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929890/extras/2f844a9c4cf55bea1d604413b7a24113.poster.avif?t=1736575655\" width=660 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929890/extras/2f844a9c4cf55bea1d604413b7a24113.webm?t=1736575655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929890/extras/2f844a9c4cf55bea1d604413b7a24113.mp4?t=1736575655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyborg City is about 17 times the Statue of Liberty's height, with 7 Zones:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Zone 0:</strong> The Cyborg City Council HQ, the nerve center where the City Ruler controls everything. The only place in the world where you can see green grass and trees, with water-flowing fountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd35 Zone 1:</strong> Residential area for citizens, with housing, schools, and hospitals, and luxurious residentials for VIP only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd35 Zone 2:</strong> The Entertainment District, full of stadiums, a gladiator arena, malls, clubs, theaters, and restaurants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd35 Zone 3:</strong> Manufacturing artificial water, food, and precious air\u2014resources that citizens of Cyborg City have to pay for to live there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd35 Zone 4:</strong> Titan Factories, where the city's most advanced cyborgs and weapon systems are created.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd35 Zone 5:</strong> Medusa's Cathedral overlooks the Common Factories and Black Market, where secret deals take place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd35 Zone 6:</strong> Under the Statue of Liberty's feet are a scrapyard and shipyard crawling with Iron Heads, surrounded by oil rigs and sewer systems.</p>",
